Package: fastconley
Type: Package
Title: Fast Conley Standard Errors for lfe and fixest Models
Version: 0.10.0
Authors@R: person("Richard", "Bluhm", email = "richard.bluhm@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Richard Bluhm <richard.bluhm@gmail.com>
Description: Conley (1999) spatial HAC standard errors for fixed effects
    panel and cross-sectional models estimated with lfe::felm() (OLS and
    IV/2SLS) or with fixest's feols() (OLS and IV), feglm(), and fepois();
    GLM fits use the M-estimation sandwich built from the stored scores and
    inverse Hessian. The spatial path uses score accumulation, a 3D cell-grid
    neighbor search, and CSR neighbor lists instead of dense distance
    matrices, yielding large speedups over rbluhm/conley on big
    cross-sections and high-dimensional regressions.
